1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ayáánurapaqa maráq máqe-uraiye.","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["áanikoma Áánûqtuma wení márûpake kaqtó-wayukama uyátáraiye."]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["Îtuma aboánáwîkaqa matáitana maamin-áwíqá áqnáabaq máiye. Áánûqtu wení márûpake kaqtó-wayukama yetíwîqa anaaépaq mááe."]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["mórama kaqtó-nákóqtábá wenôpaqa Áánûqtu mirá-tiraiyo?",{"text":"“emá ketáanikoe.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"íbêq-yupaama kemá tiráunaboa","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ketáaniko emmá mamá pááq urááne.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"kemá enaboúne.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"emá ketáanimone.”","poem":1},"téna mirá Áánûqtu móra kaqtó-nakoma wení márûpaq timá ámikaiyo? ímiye."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["Áánûqtuma wení áqnáabaq-iyapoma áwíqmena maa-márábí kúmitana agamatán-áípí wé tiráiye:",{"text":"“Áánûqtu wení máqtemma kaqtó-wayukama","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wení márûpake wekáq","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"yiraiyutaúmá áyáaro.”","poem":1},"téna Áánûqtu tiráiye."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["Áánûqtuni agamatán-áúbá-wánnáábí kaqtó-wayukayaba wení márûpaqa kétiye.",{"text":"“wení kaqtó-wayukama uwááraa káuqyikena","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"marabí-káyúkáyábá yíwáqnaa íyábá","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ira utakáá káuqyikaiye.”","poem":1},"téna"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["ááqibo wenáanitaba kétiye:",{"text":"“Áánûqtuo, ení akoqnááma máqte-tupaa","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"watúq-watuq kéiye.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ení maa-márá yabíqma","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"íráqôniq umá kémaene.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"íráqômma yanaí-yátáákón áaimma kákaimanibo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"táwîqtaba íma kákaiye.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"miráipoana ení Áánûqtuma","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mú mikákáá uyátárai-nakoma","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"íráqô-maqtawema aqnókáqá atí-akarainikaa umá","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"emá mamá múma","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"anón-amuq-yataapi máqe-uraane.”","poem":1},"téna tiráiye."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["aúba-wannaabi ókaraq kétiye:",{"text":"“uyátárai-nako, áqnáabaq-kanaama","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"maa-márá tarôq umá","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wíyômma enayáápike tarôq umákaane.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wíyôkaraq maa-márágáráq mamá","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"táwîtawaa umáginibo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"emá aati-aati-yúpáámá paá mánone.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wíyôkaraq maa-márágáráq mamá","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naayón-únáákáqtôraa umágínana","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"unáákáqtôma yatánáátá umágínikaa","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"waéqma ínóne. ááqibo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"emá íma waéqma miráinonamanibo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"matúq-matuq umá paá mánoe.”","poem":1},"mirá téna Áánûqtuni aúba-wannaabi kétiye."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["abo Áánûqtu wení kaqtó-nakoma mórama wé téna timá ámikaiyo?",{"text":"“emá ketiyáánurapaq maraq mááo.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"abo anaaékaq ení namuro-wáyúkámá","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ení aménáápáqá maránúne.”","poem":1},"Áánûqtuma móra kaqtó-nakoma mirá téna timá ámikaiyo? imiye."]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["máqte kaqtó-wayukama Áánûqtunopake aágoma mááe. máqtemma náayuwabi wenáamo yabiyína-waigo yiwiránî-kayukama yemmá yíwáqnaa ínéna kétima-yikaiye."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/usa_wbt/HEB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/usa_wbt/HEB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/ap